# v30 RE-SCORED UNDER THE FIXED EVAL RULES (2026-11-04, imitation-first plan
# Task 8): v30's own eval overlay plus the two rule fixes every imitation-first
# number is measured under, so v30 is compared on the same footing:
#   MAX_DISTANCE_M=1e9  -- the 200 m cap ended long drives as "arrivals";
#   GOAL_KEEP_ON_PASS=1 -- the env no longer moves the goal on a fast pass.
# Published (old rules) for comparison: Town02 0.560 true / 0.030 wrong,
# Town03 0.350 / 0.040 (checkpoints/sac_debitmono_t05t01_v30_evalT0{2,3}_n100,
# seed0 10000, n=100).
#
# GOAL_CAM_MATCH=1 is NOT a fix: the published runs (logs/eval_v30_wrong.sh)
# exported it on the command line beside REWARD_OVERLAY=v30_overlay.env, so it
# belongs here or the re-score would change three things instead of two. The
# clone's evals have it too (il_expert.env).
. "$REPO/slurm/v30_eval.env"
export GOAL_CAM_MATCH=1
export MAX_DISTANCE_M=1000000000 GOAL_KEEP_ON_PASS=1
